    "name": "mmrl-o2-platform-binder-filesystem-jni-root-correctness-v2",
    "description": "Corrected and re-audited O2 remediation: make provider/Binder readiness generation- and death-aware; contain privileged filesystem operations with fd-relative no-follow traversal and fail-closed mutations; harden KernelSU JNI/current-UAPI compatibility and manager authorization; make SELinux/profile transitions truthful and reconciled; correct root-manager capability, reboot, archive and inventory semantics; and harden shell/hidden-API helpers.",
